{"page":295,"verses":[{"verse_key":"18:16","surah":18,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذِ ٱعْتَزَلْتُمُوهُمْ وَمَا يَعْبُدُونَ إِلَّا ٱللَّهَ فَأْوُۥٓا۟ إِلَى ٱلْكَهْفِ يَنشُرْ لَكُمْ رَبُّكُم مِّن رَّحْمَتِهِۦ وَيُهَيِّئْ لَكُم مِّنْ أَمْرِكُم مِّرْفَقًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Now that you have left such people, and what they worshipped instead of God, take refuge in the cave. God will shower His mercy on you and make you an easy way out of your ordeal.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذِ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhi","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱعْتَزَلْتُمُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"you withdraw from them","transliteration":"iʿ'tazaltumūhum","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَعْبُدُونَ","en_gloss":"they worship","transliteration":"yaʿbudūna","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَأْوُۥٓا۟","en_gloss":"then retreat","transliteration":"fawū","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْكَهْفِ","en_gloss":"the cave","transliteration":"l-kahfi","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَنشُرْ","en_gloss":"Will spread","transliteration":"yanshur","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَبُّكُم","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbukum","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"رَّحْمَتِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His Mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatihi","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَيُهَيِّئْ","en_gloss":"and will facilitate","transliteration":"wayuhayyi","verse_key":"18:16"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":