n one another. One of them asked, ‘How long have you been here?’ and [some] answered, ‘A day or part of a day,’ but then [others] said, ‘Your Lord knows best how long you have been here. One of you go to the city with your silver coins, find out where the best food is there, and bring some back. But be careful not to let anyone know about you:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And similarly","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَعَثْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"We raised them","transliteration":"baʿathnāhum","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِيَتَسَآءَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"that they might question","transliteration":"liyatasāalū","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"Said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَآئِلٌۭ","en_gloss":"a speaker","transliteration":"qāilun","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَمْ","en_gloss":"How long","transliteration":"kam","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَبِثْتُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"have you remained","transliteration":"labith'tum","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَبِثْنَا","en_gloss":"We have remained","transliteration":"labith'nā","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَوْمًا","en_gloss":"a day","transliteration":"yawman","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَعْضَ","en_gloss":"a part","transliteration":"baʿḍa","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَوْمٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) a day","transliteration":"yawmin","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":16,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"18:19"},{"pos":17,"ar":"رَبُّكُمْ","en_gloss":"Your Lord","t